{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/765380-what-would-infulence-moonlight-look-like","id":765380,"title":"What would Infulence: Moonlight look like?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-13T23:27:10-08:00","id":765380,"title":"What would Infulence: Moonlight look like?","content":"I have been looking at the Lunes as presented in predators and most of them have Influence: Moonlight.<br /> <br /> What would that look like and would they be able to gain essence simply from being beneath any phase of the moon short of a new moon?<br /> <br /> I am also thinking of what a Lunes with influences of moonlight and love would look like and what role they would play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-16T07:14:32-08:00","id":767044,"title":"","content":"I would say that Influence: Moonlight doesn't mean the lunes need to harvest specifically moonlight essence. They are avatars/servants of Luna, so they should able to gather Luna essence from things related to Luna! e.g. Forsaken werewolves.<br /> <br /> Using that influence would probably be not super practical, but you could certainly light up an area or bend the light in fun ways. Not sure how effective it would be for achieving anything, but if anything moonlike needed some more moonlight to make more moon-essence then the lunes could certainly help.<br /> <br /> Love and moonlight? Sounds like that lune is chilling near all the hottest makeout spots.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5292-flailbot","name":"FlailBot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-16T10:01:02-08:00","id":767128,"title":"","content":"To me it doesn't just mean physical Moonlight but also Luna's love/blessing/influence. For example, auspice gifts, ability to shapeshift. Susceptibility to silver (maybe even allowing Moonlight to burn like silver) - I'd maybe even allow them to affect the ocean's tides to an extent if I had a plot hook reason for it. They could make it a darker night, unless it was already a night of the New Moon. I'm sure I could come up with more if I had time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-16T14:55:34-08:00","id":767355,"title":"","content":"It's what allows them to brand Forsaken. Even the New Moon emits some light, and even the Cunning brands glow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-16T23:36:34-08:00","id":767604,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/765380-what-would-infulence-moonlight-look-like?p=767355#post767355\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even the New Moon emits some light, and even the Cunning brands glow.</div> </div> </div> </div>They glow with blackness... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-17T06:00:09-08:00","id":767776,"title":"","content":"No, they do not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}